for slice(r24) -> L1 else L2 stages [L1, L6]
// L1: free {ref, ref, as_slice, call to_string, take}
// L6: cycle Storage(r25) keyed(r26 keys in_order) any_order law(Op(Add) exact commutative) {ref, call get, unwrap_variant, take, const, ref, +, call insert, switch, jump, jump}
// control upfront
// cost W=13 O=18281 split when n > 45000, n = len(r24)
// lower in place: its first stage spawns no heavy or io call before it waits
